# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# ML Model — Docker build context exclusions
#
# The ML Model Dockerfile (ML Model/Dockerfile) does ONLY explicit COPY lines
# for: requirements.txt, pipeline/, artifacts/, After_EDA_and_Feature_ENginering.csv
# So the .dockerignore below is mostly belt-and-suspenders — it ensures the
# build CONTEXT sent to the daemon is small (sending 17 MB of unused notebooks
# to the daemon on every rebuild is wasteful even if Dockerfile doesn't COPY them).
#
# Do NOT exclude pipeline/, artifacts/, requirements.txt, or the
# After_EDA_and_Feature_ENginering.csv file (used at runtime by serve.py).
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# --- Python virtualenvs ---
.venv
venv
**/.venv
**/venv
env/
**/env

# --- Python caches ---
__pycache__
**/__pycache__
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
*.so
.Python
*.egg-info
**/*.egg-info
.pytest_cache
.mypy_cache
.ruff_cache
.coverage
htmlcov

# --- Notebooks & notebook metadata ---
# These are huge (some >7 MB each) and never used by serve.py at runtime.
*.ipynb
**/*.ipynb
.ipynb_checkpoints
**/.ipynb_checkpoints

# --- Datasets that are NOT the one serve.py loads ---
# serve.py reads:  After_EDA_and_Feature_ENginering.csv  (KEEP)
# Everything else under dataset/ is one-off exploration output.
mobiles_data_with_predicted_antutu.csv
GSMArena_AnTuTu_Final_two.csv
GSMArena_Cleaned_Dataset.csv
GSMArenaDataset
GSMArenaDataset/**
GSMArenaDataset_BATCH*
**/GSMArenaDataset_BATCH*
# Customer dataset is used by the backend, not the ML service.
customer_dataset.csv

# --- Per-batch raw data directories ---
# The `GSMArenaDataset/` and `GSMArenaDataset_BATCH*` folders contain raw
# scrape outputs that are 100+ MB combined and unused at runtime.

# --- Scratch / debug / progress text dumps ---
cells_dump.txt
cells_dump2.txt
cells_gap.txt
preproc_cells.txt
*.dump.txt
*.scratch.*
Progress Fetch Data
**/Progress Fetch Data
web_scribing_to_fetch_data
**/web_scribing_to_fetch_data

# --- Segmentation outputs (not used by serve.py) ---
segmentation_outputs
**/segmentation_outputs

# --- Node / lockfiles (not used at all) ---
package-lock.json
node_modules

# --- Secrets & local config ---
.env
.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example

# --- Tooling & IDE caches ---
.vscode
.idea
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# --- Claude / agent state ---
.claude
.claude/**
**/.claude
CLAUDE.md
**/CLAUDE.md

# --- Docs / housekeeping ---
README.md
**/README.md
LICENSE
**/LICENSE

# --- Test artefacts ---
# NOTE: We deliberately do NOT exclude `**/test_*.py` because the Dockerfile
# does `COPY pipeline/ ./pipeline/` (whole directory). Excluding an individual
# test file inside the source tree would break the COPY. The test file is
# small (<10 KB) and harmless inside the image.
# **/test_*.py
# **/*_test.py
# **/tests/**
